1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,600
People have questions.
You have answers.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,900
Now you can get paid for them.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:11,800
Meet Maya. She's a career coach.

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:18,400
She sets her price,
and chooses how fast she'll reply.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,900
Then she shares one link,
anywhere her audience is.

6
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,800
Someone asks her about two job offers.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,400
Their card is only held, and she's paid
when she answers in time.

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,600
She replies in her own words,
and the answer lands in their inbox.

9
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,800
Their email stays private.

10
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:45,400
And if they want more, she can offer a private
15-minute conversation, right on Drop Me A Question.

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Your experience is valuable. Make it count.
dropmeaquestion.com
